<html>
<head>
	<title></title>
</head>
<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
<p><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Hi {{{Case.Contact_First_Name__c}}},</span></p>

<p><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Thank you for your recent contact.We can confirm that “Indemnity to Principal” is included on your policy. This is detailed in your policy documents, page 22 under additional covers. <i>Indemnity to Principals</i></span></p>
<span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">1. At Your request, We will extend the cover under&nbsp;this section:</span>

<p><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><i>1.a. To any principal of Yours;</i></span></p>

<p><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><i>1.b. For whom You are undertaking activities in the course of a business;</i></span></p>

<p><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><i>1.c.Where Your contract with the principal requires You to provide such cover; and</i></span></p>

<p><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><i>1.d.Where the claim arises from carrying out Your business for the principal.</i></span></p>

<p><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><i>However, We will only cover the Principal if they comply with the terms of the Policy as&nbsp;if they are You, including allowing us to retain sole conduct and control of all covered claims. </i>If you need any extra help, check out the <b>FAQ </b>section&nbsp;<a href="https://wwwadmiralbusiness.com/faqs"><b>https://www.admiralbusiness.com/faqs</b></a><a href="https://wwwadmiralbusiness.com/faqs%20"><b> </b></a>on our website or give us a call on <b>020 3808 7099</b>.&nbsp;</span></p>

<p><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Our service team are available from 9:00 to 18:00 Monday to Friday (excluding bank holidays).</span></p>
</body>
</html>